# Verification Rules

Do not claim a check passed unless it was run and observed.

Required final commands:

```bash
pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
pnpm lint
pnpm typecheck
pnpm build
pnpm test:e2e
pnpm start
```

Use Playwright against the production server.

Required test areas:

- routes;
- localization;
- path-preserving language switch;
- mobile navigation;
- project search and filters;
- excluded-repository absence;
- combined NaeonAir/WisDrone page;
- metadata;
- console errors;
- asset failures;
- responsive overflow;
- accessibility.

Use `@axe-core/playwright` on representative English/Korean pages and flagship projects.

Fix all serious and critical violations.

Capture and review the screenshots required by `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md`.

Update:

- `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md` after every phase;
- `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_REPORT.md` with actual final evidence.

If Lighthouse or another tool cannot run, document unavailability. Never invent results.

Do not call the website production-ready without build, tests, accessibility review, responsive browser inspection, and documented limitations.
